\eqn{\phi = h \left( \boldsymbol{\theta} \right)} is computed from the
standardized component parameters,
\eqn{\hat{\phi}^{\ast}_{r} = h \left( s \left(
\hat{\boldsymbol{\theta}}^{\ast}_{r} \right) \right)}.
